	quest.023F405C7F2CDCBE.quest_subtitle: "篝火已点燃！"
	quest.035AAB9130BB5BD0.quest_subtitle: "反正你无论如何都需要一大堆这些东西。"
	quest.0373EBBE7962BC69.quest_desc: ["It's a simple concept, really. Things in Minecraft will hurt you, so you hurt them &omore&r! Fight back with tooth and nail (and sword!) until it's no longer a challenge!"]
